{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":59861,"ns":0,"title":"Experiment","extract":"An experiment is a procedure carried out to support or refute a hypothesis, or determine the efficacy or likelihood of something previously untried. Experiments provide insight into cause-and-effect by demonstrating what outcome occurs when a particular factor is manipulated.","description":"Scientific procedure performed to validate a hypothesis","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}